{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18122","headline":"和裴仆射相公假山十一韵 · 韩愈","name":"和裴仆射相公假山十一韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公乎真爱山，看山旦连夕。\n犹嫌山在眼，不得着脚历。\n枉语山中人，匄我涧侧石。\n有来应公须，归必载金帛。\n当轩乍骈罗，随势忽开坼。\n有洞若神剜，有岩类天划。\n终朝岩洞间，歌鼓燕宾戚。\n孰谓衡霍期，近在王侯宅。\n傅氏筑已卑，磻溪钓何激。\n逍遥功德下，不与事相摭。\n乐我盛明朝，於焉傲今昔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}